    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight giant bugs with your mech!</strong> Liberate the alien planet for your cause. In this top-down twin stick shooter, fight bugs as you secure the planet for humankind.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646610/extras/6794b58721d41121df28792a50f3a6fe.poster.avif?t=1750536361\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646610/extras/6794b58721d41121df28792a50f3a6fe.webm?t=1750536361\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646610/extras/6794b58721d41121df28792a50f3a6fe.mp4?t=1750536361\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Five weapons</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you need a strong sniper rifle or a crowd-controlling grenade launcher, these weapons will help you get the job done.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646610/extras/675497e976eeae2cdc6f5768137a984e.poster.avif?t=1750536361\" width=800 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646610/extras/675497e976eeae2cdc6f5768137a984e.webm?t=1750536361\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646610/extras/675497e976eeae2cdc6f5768137a984e.mp4?t=1750536361\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Numerous bug types</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varying from hard-headed turtle ants to stag beetles, wolf spiders to tiny swarm bees, squash all the bugs you can find!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646610/extras/22dc4802b6a46b524bd447f4819b05e1.poster.avif?t=1750536361\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646610/extras/22dc4802b6a46b524bd447f4819b05e1.webm?t=1750536361\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646610/extras/22dc4802b6a46b524bd447f4819b05e1.mp4?t=1750536361\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 areas</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From massive beehive to spiders nest, these bug-infested levels need to be cleared out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646610/extras/264705ae59a17a40802140d1eacabe50.poster.avif?t=1750536361\" width=800 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646610/extras/264705ae59a17a40802140d1eacabe50.webm?t=1750536361\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646610/extras/264705ae59a17a40802140d1eacabe50.mp4?t=1750536361\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight giant bugs with your mech!</strong> Liberate the alien planet for your cause. In this top-down twin stick shooter, fight bugs as you secure the planet for humankind.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646610/extras/6794b58721d41121df28792a50f3a6fe.poster.avif?t=1750536361\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646610/extras/6794b58721d41121df28792a50f3a6fe.webm?t=1750536361\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646610/extras/6794b58721d41121df28792a50f3a6fe.mp4?t=1750536361\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Five weapons</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you need a strong sniper rifle or a crowd-controlling grenade launcher, these weapons will help you get the job done.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646610/extras/675497e976eeae2cdc6f5768137a984e.poster.avif?t=1750536361\" width=800 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646610/extras/675497e976eeae2cdc6f5768137a984e.webm?t=1750536361\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646610/extras/675497e976eeae2cdc6f5768137a984e.mp4?t=1750536361\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Numerous bug types</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varying from hard-headed turtle ants to stag beetles, wolf spiders to tiny swarm bees, squash all the bugs you can find!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646610/extras/22dc4802b6a46b524bd447f4819b05e1.poster.avif?t=1750536361\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646610/extras/22dc4802b6a46b524bd447f4819b05e1.webm?t=1750536361\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646610/extras/22dc4802b6a46b524bd447f4819b05e1.mp4?t=1750536361\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 areas</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From massive beehive to spiders nest, these bug-infested levels need to be cleared out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646610/extras/264705ae59a17a40802140d1eacabe50.poster.avif?t=1750536361\" width=800 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646610/extras/264705ae59a17a40802140d1eacabe50.webm?t=1750536361\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646610/extras/264705ae59a17a40802140d1eacabe50.mp4?t=1750536361\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
